			<item>
				<title>《永冻纪元》紧急推送Hotfix 2：RTX 40/50系显卡禁用FSR，告别频繁闪退</title>
				<link>https://info.steamhunter.link/posts/2026-10-10-2254990-0529b32e/</link>
